se" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,0][0,0]" /><node index="6" text="银行、支付、钱包、密码和验证器类 App 默认排除；摘要只用于当前对话背景，不会仅凭它写入长期记忆。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="home.dengta.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,0][0,0]" /><node index="7" text="摘要已更新：仅包含 6 个 App 名称和粗略使用时长。" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="home.dengta.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,0][0,0]" /><node index="8" text="打开系统授权" resource-id="" class="android.widget.Button" package="home.dengta.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,0][0,0]" /><node index="9" text="更新摘要" resource-id="" class="android.widget.Button" package="home.dengta.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,0][0,0]" /><node index="10" text="关闭并清除" resource-id="" class="android.widget.Button" package="home.dengta.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,0][0,0]" /><node index="11" text="Android 的“使用情况访问”是单独的系统权限；关闭本功能会立即停止附带摘要，撤销系统权限仍需在授权页操作。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="home.dengta.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,0][0,0]" /><node index="12" text="音乐识别（彩虹胶囊显示正在播放）" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="home.dengta.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,0][0,0]" /><node index="13" text="已授权 · 播放时自动显示" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="home.dengta.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,0][0,0]" /><node index="14" text="授权后，只要你在网易云、QQ 音乐或系统播放器里放歌，聊天页的彩虹胶囊就会变成旋转唱片，显示歌名、歌手、封面和播放控制（暂停 / 下一首）。仅读取媒体通知，不读取消息内容。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="home.dengta.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,0][0,0]" /><node index="15" text="授权入口在系统设置 → 通知与状态栏 → 通知使用权 → 允许“灯塔”。授权后回到本页，状态会自动更新。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="home.dengta.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,0][0,0]" /><node index="16" text="屏幕共看" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="home.dengta.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,0][0,0]" /><node index="17" text="Android · 系统正在共享" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="home.dengta.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" check